59 x1ey2m1c xgcd1z6 x1txdalj xf314gf xfsso4q x1wesfrj"><div class="x78zum5 x6s0dn4 xzye2dw"></div></div></nav></div></div><div class="x2lwn1j xeuugli x1iyjqo2"><div role="main" class="astryx-layout-content x9f619 x5yr21d x98rzlu x2lwn1j x7giv3 xqp078j x160ivqr xk6660b x2izi54 xserb3f xx5lg5w x17h9kl7 x15vxphk" id="astryx-app-shell-main"><div class="astryx-grid columns-2 xrvj5dj xicv188 p1lweo1u pvueqy4 p63bdn6 paregq5 p1lc3x33" data-columns="2" style="--x-gridTemplateColumns:repeat(2, 1fr);width:100%"><article data-docs-article="true" class="peuugli ph8yej3 pdx07kf pa31obi p199utx p10lawvc p1ykspdu pxazisf"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"TechArticle","@id":"https://dev.meta.ai/docs/overview#article","headline":"Get started with Meta Model API and Muse Code - Muse Wonder, Muse Spark, Muse Image, Muse Voice Transcribe, Segment Anything Model, Muse Spark Open, and Muse Glimmer","description":"Build with Meta Model API and Muse Code: call Muse Wonder for complex coding and long-horizon agentic work or Muse Spark for agentic and coding work at scale, generate and edit images with Muse Image, transcribe speech with Muse Voice Transcribe, segment images and video with Segment Anything Model, or download the Muse Spark Open and Muse Glimmer open weights.","keywords":"Meta Model API, Muse Code, Muse Wonder, Muse Spark, Muse Image, Muse Voice Transcribe, Segment Anything Model, Muse Spark Open, Muse Glimmer, open weights, quickstart, cookbook","url":"https://dev.meta.ai/docs/overview","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://dev.meta.ai/docs/overview"},"inLanguage":"en","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://dev.meta.ai/#website","name":"Meta Model API","url":"https://dev.meta.ai/"}}</script>
<h1 class="astryx-heading level-1 primary x1tgivj0 x1v68xuy x1lliihq p10srzze p1ufwgs ptbrsbv peqlt5" data-level="1" data-color="primary" id="build-with-meta-model-api-and-muse-code"><a to="#build-with-meta-model-api-and-muse-code" class="astryx-link primary x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1hl2dhg x4ohgrr x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk x1tgivj0 x4z56r7" data-color="primary" href="#build-with-meta-model-api-and-muse-code"><span class="astryx-text inherit primary x1tgivj0 x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz xt0psk2" data-type="inherit" data-color="primary">Build with Meta Model API and Muse Code</span></a></h1><div class="astryx-stack vertical gap-2 xdt5ytf xak3so x1x7z4sm p1s85apg p9uq8br" data-direction="vertical" data-gap="2"><button type="button" class="astryx-button secondary sm x1n2onr6 x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 xl56j7k x1txdalj xce4md1 xrrkdod xc342km xng3xce x1jxw6zd xjb2p0i xcr08ib x1kq96og x1e4wzip xuxw1ft x1ypdohk xrafxwg xuedmi6 x12w9bfk xlr8y92 x17x4s8c x1tgivj0 x1ilzqfv xq8i9tn x17nn4n9 xkzo27j x1wfwxd8 x13aywxo x3oybdh xk4oym4 x1gnnqk1 pqcrz7y pn3w4p2" data-variant="secondary" data-size="sm" aria-controls="_R_1lfiuqipfjfmivb_" aria-expanded="false"><span class="xjp7ctv"><span class="xb3r6kr xlyipyv xeuugli">Table of contents</span><span class="x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1heor9g"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" width="16" height="16"><path d="M24.62 12.38a.876.876 0 0 1 0 1.24l-8 8a.876.876 0 0 1-1.24 0l-8-8a.876.876 0 0 1 1.24-1.24L16 19.763l7.38-7.381a.876.876 0 0 1 1.24 0z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></span><span role="status" aria-live="polite" class="x10l6tqk x1i1rx1s xjm9jq1 xkdpibf x1717udv xb3r6kr xzpqnlu xuxw1ft xng3xce x13vifvy x1o0tod x47corl x87ps6o"></span></button><div class="astryx-grid xrvj5dj xqketvx pihq33y pg01cxk p2rcmwa p1erjwpq plr8y92 p12w9bfk" style="--x-gridTemplateColumns:1fr" aria-hidden="true" id="_R_1lfiuqipfjfmivb_" inert=""><div class="astryx-stack vertical x78zum5 xdt5ytf p2lwn1j pb3r6kr" data-direction="vertical"><nav aria-label="Table of contents" class="astryx-outline compact x78zum5 x1q0g3np x1n2onr6 x1lsbc85 xh8yej3" data-density="compact"><ul class="x78zum5 xdt5ytf x1lsbc85 x1ghz6dp x1717udv xe8uvvx x98rzlu xeuugli" role="list"></ul><div class="x1n2onr6 xfo62xy x2lah0s x1clqncf" aria-hidden="true"><span class="x10l6tqk x13vifvy x1ey2m1c x1o0tod xfo62xy x1m4xfpy xjspbzw x47corl"></span></div><span class="astryx-outline-indicator x10l6tqk x1o0tod xfo62xy xowkcby xjspbzw x47corl x1vjfegm x1tsffl5 x1ltwjim x1qjb5ga x1xuz8iz xkvfbh3 xlr8y92" aria-hidden="true"></span></nav></div></div></div>
<p class="astryx-text body primary x1tgivj0 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e x1lliihq pfo4z36 p1ewvobj" data-type="body" data-color="primary">Your next build starts with Muse. Meta Model API is an inference API for the latest models from Meta, including Muse Wonder and Muse Spark, and <a to="#muse-code" class="astryx-link accent x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk xjse4m1 x17qfo7y x1bvjpef" data-color="accent" href="#muse-code"><span class="astryx-text body accent xjse4m1 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e xt0psk2" data-type="body" data-color="accent">Muse Code</span></a> is a coding agent built for Muse Spark. Call the API to build your own app or agent, or run Muse Code for a ready-made agent in your terminal — same models, same auth.</p>
<p class="astryx-text body primary x1tgivj0 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e x1lliihq pfo4z36 p1ewvobj" data-type="body" data-color="primary"><a to="#muse-wonder" class="astryx-link accent x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk xjse4m1 x17qfo7y x1bvjpef" data-color="accent" href="#muse-wonder"><span class="astryx-text body accent xjse4m1 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e xt0psk2" data-type="body" data-color="accent">Muse Wonder</span></a> is Meta&#x27;s most capable model, built for complex software engineering and long-horizon agentic work. It makes changes across many files in real repositories, delegates to sub-agents, and works through long tasks with parallel tool calls and a 1M-token context window.</p>
<p class="astryx-text body primary x1tgivj0 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e x1lliihq pfo4z36 p1ewvobj" data-type="body" data-color="primary"><a to="#muse-spark" class="astryx-link accent x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk xjse4m1 x17qfo7y x1bvjpef" data-color="accent" href="#muse-spark"><span class="astryx-text body accent xjse4m1 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e xt0psk2" data-type="body" data-color="accent">Muse Spark</span></a> is served through Model API, with agent-ready primitives and no extra setup: parallel tool calls, streamed tool-call arguments, reasoning that carries across turns, and a 1M-token context window.</p>
<p class="astryx-text body primary x1tgivj0 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e x1lliihq pfo4z36 p1ewvobj" data-type="body" data-color="primary"><a to="#muse-image" class="astryx-link accent x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk xjse4m1 x17qfo7y x1bvjpef" data-color="accent" href="#muse-image"><span class="astryx-text body accent xjse4m1 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e xt0psk2" data-type="body" data-color="accent">Muse Image</span></a> is served through Model API too. It generates and edits images from a text prompt and refines them across turns.</p>
<p class="astryx-text body primary x1tgivj0 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e x1lliihq pfo4z36 p1ewvobj" data-type="body" data-color="primary"><a to="#muse-voice-transcribe" class="astryx-link accent x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk xjse4m1 x17qfo7y x1bvjpef" data-color="accent" href="#muse-voice-transcribe"><span class="astryx-text body accent xjse4m1 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e xt0psk2" data-type="body" data-color="accent">Muse Voice Transcribe</span></a> is a speech-to-text model on Model API. It transcribes streaming and non-streaming audio, with speaker attribution and turn detection in the model.</p>
<p class="astryx-text body primary x1tgivj0 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e x1lliihq pfo4z36 p1ewvobj" data-type="body" data-color="primary"><a to="#sam-3" class="astryx-link accent x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk xjse4m1 x17qfo7y x1bvjpef" data-color="accent" href="#sam-3"><span class="astryx-text body accent xjse4m1 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e xt0psk2" data-type="body" data-color="accent">Segment Anything Model 3.1 (SAM 3.1)</span></a>, an open-weight model from Meta, is also available on Model API. It finds and outlines objects in images and video from a short text prompt, returning boxes and masks.</p>
<p class="astryx-text body primary x1tgivj0 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e x1lliihq pfo4z36 p1ewvobj" data-type="body" data-color="primary"><a to="#muse-spark-open" class="astryx-link accent x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk xjse4m1 x17qfo7y x1bvjpef" data-color="accent" href="#muse-spark-open"><span class="astryx-text body accent xjse4m1 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e xt0psk2" data-type="body" data-color="accent">Muse Spark Open</span></a> is the open-weight release of Muse Spark. Download the BF16 or NVFP4 checkpoint and serve it on your own GPUs, or call it through a hosted inference provider.</p>
<p class="astryx-text body primary x1tgivj0 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e x1lliihq pfo4z36 p1ewvobj" data-type="body" data-color="primary"><a to="#muse-glimmer" class="astryx-link accent x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk xjse4m1 x17qfo7y x1bvjpef" data-color="accent" href="#muse-glimmer"><span class="astryx-text body accent xjse4m1 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e xt0psk2" data-type="body" data-color="accent">Muse Glimmer</span></a> is open-weight too, built for local and edge deployment: you download the weights and run it on your own hardware instead of calling it through Model API, under a permissive Apache 2.0 license.</p>
<p class="astryx-text body primary x1tgivj0 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e x1lliihq pfo4z36 p1ewvobj" data-type="body" data-color="primary"><a to="#muse-code" class="astryx-link accent x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk xjse4m1 x17qfo7y x1bvjpef" data-color="accent" href="#muse-code"><span class="astryx-text body accent xjse4m1 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e xt0psk2" data-type="body" data-color="accent">Muse Code</span></a> is a coding agent from Meta for the terminal and CI, built for Muse Spark and powered by Model API. Install it, sign in, and run it in a project. It plans, edits, and runs commands to do tasks, with approvals and an OS sandbox on from the first run.</p>
<h2 class="astryx-heading level-2 primary x1tgivj0 x1xvnhcw x1cpk1wn x12yy4cs x1lliihq p1pc3f07 p13fuv20 p6gwkdc p11xkdxz phrwaqf pep27e5 p1adxfkp pmsqn1h" data-level="2" data-color="primary" id="muse-code"><a to="#muse-code" class="astryx-link primary x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1hl2dhg x4ohgrr x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk x1tgivj0 x4z56r7" data-color="primary" href="#muse-code"><span class="astryx-text inherit primary x1tgivj0 x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz xt0psk2" data-type="inherit" data-color="primary">Build with Muse Code</span></a></h2>
<p class="astryx-text body primary x1tgivj0 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e x1lliihq pfo4z36 p1ewvobj" data-type="body" data-color="primary">Install the CLI on macOS or Linux:</p>
<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=""><pre class="astryx-codeblock md bash card x1n2onr6 xc8icb0 x78zum5 xdt5ytf x1ghz6dp xzyc27v xb3r6kr x5lhr3w xh6dtrn x1litavf x1y0btm7 x14i3s5s p1ie71f1 p193iq5w peuugli" data-size="md" data-language="bash" data-container="card" style="--x-width:100%"><div class="x78zum5 x6s0dn4 x1qughib x1pzlopt xzyc27v x7wzq59 x13vifvy x1vjfegm xce4md1"><div class="x78zum5 x6s0dn4 x98rzlu xeuugli x1717udv xjbqb8w x1heor9g xln7xf2 x1yc453h"><span class="x78zum5 x6s0dn4 x141an7d x9m5x89 x1e4wzip x1mjzq1q x1ghz6dp x1ltkj2j">bash</span></div><button type="button" aria-label="Copy code" class="x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 xl56j7k x9epnlk x3kzqx6 xx3sua9 xjbqb8w xe9uy6x x1mjzq1q x1ypdohk x14ju556"><span aria-hidden="true" class="astryx-icon sm inherit x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 xl56j7k x2lah0s x1heor9g xcdlrvm x1l36t39 x1jchvi3" data-size="sm" data-color="inherit"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="1em" height="1em" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 4v12a2 2 0 002 2h8a2 2 0 002-2V7.242a2 2 0 00-.602-1.43L16.083 2.57A2 2 0 0014.685 2H10a2 2 0 00-2 2z"></path><path d="M16 18v2a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V9a2 2 0 012-2h2"></path></svg></span></button></div><div tabindex="0" role="group" aria-label="bash" class="xw2csxc x1odjw0f"><div class="x78zum5 x1pshirs x1ajqlyv"><code class="x1lliihq x98rzlu x8o8v82 x1pzlopt x1ghz6dp x9m5x89 xdfisg xeq4nuv x1sdyfia x1lldw8n x1h4wwuj xp03k98"><div data-line="1" class="x17iicif"><span class="xeuugli">curl -fsSL https://dev.meta.ai/install.sh <span class="astryx-token-operator xds-token-operator">|</span> sh</span></div></code></div></div></pre></figure>
<p class="astryx-text body primary x1tgivj0 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e x1lliihq pfo4z36 p1ewvobj" data-type="body" data-color="primary">Or install it on Windows with PowerShell:</p>
<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=""><pre class="astryx-codeblock md powershell card x1n2onr6 xc8icb0 x78zum5 xdt5ytf x1ghz6dp xzyc27v xb3r6kr x5lhr3w xh6dtrn x1litavf x1y0btm7 x14i3s5s p1ie71f1 p193iq5w peuugli" data-size="md" data-language="powershell" data-container="card" style="--x-width:100%"><div class="x78zum5 x6s0dn4 x1qughib x1pzlopt xzyc27v x7wzq59 x13vifvy x1vjfegm xce4md1"><div class="x78zum5 x6s0dn4 x98rzlu xeuugli x1717udv xjbqb8w x1heor9g xln7xf2 x1yc453h"><span class="x78zum5 x6s0dn4 x141an7d x9m5x89 x1e4wzip x1mjzq1q x1ghz6dp x1ltkj2j">powershell</span></div><button type="button" aria-label="Copy code" class="x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 xl56j7k x9epnlk x3kzqx6 xx3sua9 xjbqb8w xe9uy6x x1mjzq1q x1ypdohk x14ju556"><span aria-hidden="true" class="astryx-icon sm inherit x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 xl56j7k x2lah0s x1heor9g xcdlrvm x1l36t39 x1jchvi3" data-size="sm" data-color="inherit"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="1em" height="1em" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 4v12a2 2 0 002 2h8a2 2 0 002-2V7.242a2 2 0 00-.602-1.43L16.083 2.57A2 2 0 0014.685 2H10a2 2 0 00-2 2z"></path><path d="M16 18v2a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V9a2 2 0 012-2h2"></path></svg></span></button></div><div tabindex="0" role="group" aria-label="powershell" class="xw2csxc x1odjw0f"><div class="x78zum5 x1pshirs x1ajqlyv"><code class="x1lliihq x98rzlu x8o8v82 x1pzlopt x1ghz6dp x9m5x89 xdfisg xeq4nuv x1sdyfia x1lldw8n x1h4wwuj xp03k98"><div data-line="1" class="x17iicif"><span class="xeuugli">irm https://dev.meta.ai/install.ps1 | iex</span></div></code></div></div></pre></figure>
<p class="astryx-text body primary x1tgivj0 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e x1lliihq pfo4z36 p1ewvobj" data-type="body" data-color="primary">Start building:</p>
<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=""><pre class="astryx-codeblock md bash card x1n2onr6 xc8icb0 x78zum5 xdt5ytf x1ghz6dp xzyc27v xb3r6kr x5lhr3w xh6dtrn x1litavf x1y0btm7 x14i3s5s p1ie71f1 p193iq5w peuugli" data-size="md" data-language="bash" data-container="card" style="--x-width:100%"><div class="x78zum5 x6s0dn4 x1qughib x1pzlopt xzyc27v x7wzq59 x13vifvy x1vjfegm xce4md1"><div class="x78zum5 x6s0dn4 x98rzlu xeuugli x1717udv xjbqb8w x1heor9g xln7xf2 x1yc453h"><span class="x78zum5 x6s0dn4 x141an7d x9m5x89 x1e4wzip x1mjzq1q x1ghz6dp x1ltkj2j">bash</span></div><button type="button" aria-label="Copy code" class="x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 xl56j7k x9epnlk x3kzqx6 xx3sua9 xjbqb8w xe9uy6x x1mjzq1q x1ypdohk x14ju556"><span aria-hidden="true" class="astryx-icon sm inherit x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 xl56j7k x2lah0s x1heor9g xcdlrvm x1l36t39 x1jchvi3" data-size="sm" data-color="inherit"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="1em" height="1em" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 4v12a2 2 0 002 2h8a2 2 0 002-2V7.242a2 2 0 00-.602-1.43L16.083 2.57A2 2 0 0014.685 2H10a2 2 0 00-2 2z"></path><path d="M16 18v2a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V9a2 2 0 012-2h2"></path></svg></span></button></div><div tabindex="0" role="group" aria-label="bash" class="xw2csxc x1odjw0f"><div class="x78zum5 x1pshirs x1ajqlyv"><code class="x1lliihq x98rzlu x8o8v82 x1pzlopt x1ghz6dp x9m5x89 xdfisg xeq4nuv x1sdyfia x1lldw8n x1h4wwuj xp03k98"><div data-line="1" class="x17iicif"><span class="xeuugli">muse   <span class="astryx-token-comment xds-token-comment"># start Muse Code; on first run, choose a browser sign-in or paste an API key</span></span></div></code></div></div></pre></figure>
<div role="status" class="x78zum5 xdt5ytf xjb2p0i x1gnnqk1 p1ie71f1 p193iq5w peuugli"><div class="astryx-banner card info x78zum5 x1cy8zhl x1txdalj x8o8v82 x1pzlopt xgcxg3y x1hviunn" data-container="card" data-status="info"><div class="astryx-banner-icon info x78zum5 x6s0dn4 x2lah0s" data-status="info" aria-hidden="true"><span aria-hidden="true" class="astryx-icon md accent x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 xl56j7k x2lah0s xqwr325 xwqq7k2 xmll18r x1603h9y" data-size="md" data-color="accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" width="1em" height="1em" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 3a9 9 0 100 18 9 9 0 000-18zm0 4a1 1 0 100 2 1 1 0 000-2zm-.75 3.75a.75.75 0 011.5 0v5.5a.75.75 0 01-1.5 0v-5.5z"></path></svg></span></div><div class="x78zum5 xdt5ytf xxhr3t x98rzlu xeuugli"><div class="x1ghz6dp xjb2p0i xcr08ib x2mo6ok x1kq96og x1tgivj0">Muse Code or the API</div><div class="x1ghz6dp xjb2p0i x141an7d x1sodnla x1ltkj2j xv1l7n4"><p class="astryx-text body primary x1tgivj0 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e x1lliihq pfo4z36 p1ewvobj" data-type="body" data-color="primary">Muse Code and the API are two ways to use the same model. Run Muse Code for a ready-made agent at the command line or in CI; call the API directly when you build your own agent or app.</p></div></div></div></div>
<p class="astryx-text body primary x1tgivj0 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e x1lliihq pfo4z36 p1ewvobj" data-type="body" data-color="primary">Learn more in the <a to="/docs/muse-code" class="astryx-link accent x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk xjse4m1 x17qfo7y x1bvjpef" data-color="accent" href="/docs/muse-code"><span class="astryx-text body accent xjse4m1 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e xt0psk2" data-type="body" data-color="accent">Muse Code overview</span></a>.</p>
<h2 class="astryx-heading level-2 primary x1tgivj0 x1xvnhcw x1cpk1wn x12yy4cs x1lliihq p1pc3f07 p13fuv20 p6gwkdc p11xkdxz phrwaqf pep27e5 p1adxfkp pmsqn1h" data-level="2" data-color="primary" id="muse-wonder"><a to="#muse-wonder" class="astryx-link primary x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1hl2dhg x4ohgrr x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk x1tgivj0 x4z56r7" data-color="primary" href="#muse-wonder"><span class="astryx-text inherit primary x1tgivj0 x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz xt0psk2" data-type="inherit" data-color="primary">Build with Muse Wonder</span></a></h2>
<p class="astryx-text body primary x1tgivj0 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e x1lliihq pfo4z36 p1ewvobj" data-type="body" data-color="primary">Run Muse Wonder for complex coding work and for agents that plan, delegate to sub-agents, and work through long tasks. Muse Wonder and Muse Spark take the same requests, so any example in these docs that uses Muse Spark also runs on Muse Wonder: change the model to <code class="astryx-code primary x9m5x89 xp03k98 x15bjb6t xwmxj5m x7a5moj x1hp7d8q xx3sua9 x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1tgivj0" data-color="primary">muse-wonder-1.0</code>. Muse Wonder takes on longer, more complex tasks; Muse Spark costs less and, on Model API, offers a discounted Contributor mode.</p>
<h3 class="astryx-heading level-3 primary x1tgivj0 xii13ha xwjzt0u x1jcxfy8 x1lliihq p13rv44w p1p37lm5" data-level="3" data-color="primary" id="muse-wonder-at-a-glance"><a to="#muse-wonder-at-a-glance" class="astryx-link primary x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1hl2dhg x4ohgrr x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk x1tgivj0 x4z56r7" data-color="primary" href="#muse-wonder-at-a-glance"><span class="astryx-text inherit primary x1tgivj0 x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz xt0psk2" data-type="inherit" data-color="primary">At a glance</span></a></h3>
<div class="astryx-card default x2kkz0m x153u1i6 x7giv3 x1p8z4y0 x1de1mus xw28qpl x9f619 xswhm3q x1mzf5mb xj1bl4l xwuefyo x1gu2k80 x91ghl5 x1i3qcxz xkunwnr x1litavf x1y0btm7 x14i3s5s xs19ii7 x12frdag x1nex4ik xbv1mwh p1ie71f1 p193iq5w peuugli ph8yej3" data-variant="default"><div tabindex="0" role="group" aria-label="Table" class="astryx-table-scroll-wrapper xw2csxc x5lxg6s xojxgvx x1fcf3bl xx6qvi6 xkibk3 xlayyun"><table class="astryx-base-table xh8yej3 x1mwwwfo x1gukg7c x1drmoe9 xjb2p0i x1tgivj0 astryx-table"><tbody><tr class="astryx-table-row x139im0d"><td class="astryx-table-cell xce4md1 xrrkdod xjm74w1 x9f619 xb3r6kr x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1m189uc x9bi00s xpilulx x16dsc37 x92x3c3 x1wp2rvj x1q0q8m5 xw8gpjh"><strong>Base URL</strong></td><td class="astryx-table-cell xce4md1 xrrkdod xjm74w1 x9f619 xb3r6kr x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1m189uc x9bi00s xpilulx x16dsc37 x92x3c3 x1wp2rvj x1q0q8m5 xw8gpjh"><code class="astryx-code primary x9m5x89 xp03k98 x15bjb6t xwmxj5m x7a5moj x1hp7d8q xx3sua9 x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1tgivj0" data-color="primary">https://api.meta.ai/v1</code></td></tr><tr class="astryx-table-row x139im0d"><td class="astryx-table-cell xce4md1 xrrkdod xjm74w1 x9f619 xb3r6kr x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1m189uc x9bi00s xpilulx x16dsc37 x92x3c3 x1wp2rvj x1q0q8m5 xw8gpjh"><strong><a to="/docs/pricing-rate-limits#standard-mode" class="astryx-link accent x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk xjse4m1 x17qfo7y x1bvjpef" data-color="accent" href="/docs/pricing-rate-limits#standard-mode"><span class="astryx-text body accent xjse4m1 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e xt0psk2" data-type="body" data-color="accent">Standard mode</span></a> model</strong></td><td class="astryx-table-cell xce4md1 xrrkdod xjm74w1 x9f619 xb3r6kr x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1m189uc x9bi00s xpilulx x16dsc37 x92x3c3 x1wp2rvj x1q0q8m5 xw8gpjh"><code class="astryx-code primary x9m5x89 xp03k98 x15bjb6t xwmxj5m x7a5moj x1hp7d8q xx3sua9 x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1tgivj0" data-color="primary">muse-wonder-1.0</code></td></tr><tr class="astryx-table-row x139im0d"><td class="astryx-table-cell xce4md1 xrrkdod xjm74w1 x9f619 xb3r6kr x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1m189uc x9bi00s xpilulx x16dsc37 x92x3c3 x1wp2rvj x1q0q8m5 xw8gpjh"><strong>Context window</strong></td><td class="astryx-table-cell xce4md1 xrrkdod xjm74w1 x9f619 xb3r6kr x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1m189uc x9bi00s xpilulx x16dsc37 x92x3c3 x1wp2rvj x1q0q8m5 xw8gpjh">1,048,576 tokens</td></tr><tr class="astryx-table-row x139im0d"><td class="astryx-table-cell xce4md1 xrrkdod xjm74w1 x9f619 xb3r6kr x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1m189uc x9bi00s xpilulx x16dsc37 x92x3c3 x1wp2rvj x1q0q8m5 xw8gpjh"><strong>Auth</strong></td><td class="astryx-table-cell xce4md1 xrrkdod xjm74w1 x9f619 xb3r6kr x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1m189uc x9bi00s xpilulx x16dsc37 x92x3c3 x1wp2rvj x1q0q8m5 xw8gpjh">Bearer token (<code class="astryx-code primary x9m5x89 xp03k98 x15bjb6t xwmxj5m x7a5moj x1hp7d8q xx3sua9 x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1tgivj0" data-color="primary">MODEL_API_KEY</code>)</td></tr><tr class="astryx-table-row x139im0d"><td class="astryx-table-cell xce4md1 xrrkdod xjm74w1 x9f619 xb3r6kr x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1m189uc x9bi00s xpilulx x16dsc37 x92x3c3 x1wp2rvj x1q0q8m5 xw8gpjh"><strong>Pricing</strong></td><td class="astryx-table-cell xce4md1 xrrkdod xjm74w1 x9f619 xb3r6kr x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1m189uc x9bi00s xpilulx x16dsc37 x92x3c3 x1wp2rvj x1q0q8m5 xw8gpjh">Pay-as-you-go; see <a to="/docs/pricing-rate-limits#muse-wonder-pricing" class="astryx-link accent x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk xjse4m1 x17qfo7y x1bvjpef" data-color="accent" href="/docs/pricing-rate-limits#muse-wonder-pricing"><span class="astryx-text body accent xjse4m1 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e xt0psk2" data-type="body" data-color="accent">Pricing and rate limits</span></a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<h3 class="astryx-heading level-3 primary x1tgivj0 xii13ha xwjzt0u x1jcxfy8 x1lliihq p13rv44w p1p37lm5" data-level="3" data-color="primary" id="muse-wonder-first-call"><a to="#muse-wonder-first-call" class="astryx-link primary x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1hl2dhg x4ohgrr x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk x1tgivj0 x4z56r7" data-color="primary" href="#muse-wonder-first-call"><span class="astryx-text inherit primary x1tgivj0 x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz xt0psk2" data-type="inherit" data-color="primary">Make your first call</span></a></h3>
<p class="astryx-text body primary x1tgivj0 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e x1lliihq pfo4z36 p1ewvobj" data-type="body" data-color="primary">Send a request to the <a to="/docs/protocols/responses" class="astryx-link accent x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk xjse4m1 x17qfo7y x1bvjpef" data-color="accent" href="/docs/protocols/responses"><span class="astryx-text body accent xjse4m1 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e xt0psk2" data-type="body" data-color="accent">Responses API</span></a> with your <code class="astryx-code primary x9m5x89 xp03k98 x15bjb6t xwmxj5m x7a5moj x1hp7d8q xx3sua9 x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1tgivj0" data-color="primary">MODEL_API_KEY</code>:</p>
<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=""><pre class="astryx-codeblock md shell card x1n2onr6 xc8icb0 x78zum5 xdt5ytf x1ghz6dp xzyc27v xb3r6kr x5lhr3w xh6dtrn x1litavf x1y0btm7 x14i3s5s p1ie71f1 p193iq5w peuugli" data-size="md" data-language="shell" data-container="card" style="--x-width:100%"><div class="x78zum5 x6s0dn4 x1qughib x1pzlopt xzyc27v x7wzq59 x13vifvy x1vjfegm xce4md1"><div class="x78zum5 x6s0dn4 x98rzlu xeuugli x1717udv xjbqb8w x1heor9g xln7xf2 x1yc453h"><span class="x78zum5 x6s0dn4 x141an7d x9m5x89 x1e4wzip x1mjzq1q x1ghz6dp x1ltkj2j">shell</span></div><button type="button" aria-label="Copy code" class="x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 xl56j7k x9epnlk x3kzqx6 xx3sua9 xjbqb8w xe9uy6x x1mjzq1q x1ypdohk x14ju556"><span aria-hidden="true" class="astryx-icon sm inherit x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 xl56j7k x2lah0s x1heor9g xcdlrvm x1l36t39 x1jchvi3" data-size="sm" data-color="inherit"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="1em" height="1em" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 4v12a2 2 0 002 2h8a2 2 0 002-2V7.242a2 2 0 00-.602-1.43L16.083 2.57A2 2 0 0014.685 2H10a2 2 0 00-2 2z"></path><path d="M16 18v2a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V9a2 2 0 012-2h2"></path></svg></span></button></div><div tabindex="0" role="group" aria-label="shell" class="xw2csxc x1odjw0f"><div class="x78zum5 x1pshirs x1ajqlyv"><code class="x1lliihq x98rzlu x8o8v82 x1pzlopt x1ghz6dp x9m5x89 xdfisg xeq4nuv x1sdyfia x1lldw8n x1h4wwuj xp03k98"><div data-line="1" class="x17iicif"><span class="xeuugli">curl -X POST <span class="astryx-token-string xds-token-string">&quot;https://api.meta.ai/v1/responses&quot;</span> \</span></div><div data-line="2" class="x17iicif"><span class="xeuugli">  -H <span class="astryx-token-string xds-token-string">&quot;Authorization: Bearer $MODEL_API_KEY&quot;</span> \</span></div><div data-line="3" class="x17iicif"><span class="xeuugli">  -H <span class="astryx-token-string xds-token-string">&quot;Content-Type: application/json&quot;</span> \</span></div><div data-line="4" class="x17iicif"><span class="xeuugli">  -d <span class="astryx-token-string xds-token-string">&#x27;{</span></span></div><div data-line="5" class="x17iicif"><span class="xeuugli">  <span class="astryx-token-string xds-token-string">&quot;model&quot;</span>: <span class="astryx-token-string xds-token-string">&quot;muse-wonder-1.0&quot;</span>,</span></div><div data-line="6" class="x17iicif"><span class="xeuugli">  <span class="astryx-token-string xds-token-string">&quot;reasoning&quot;</span>: <span class="astryx-token-punctuation xds-token-punctuation">{</span></span></div><div data-line="7" class="x17iicif"><span class="xeuugli">    <span class="astryx-token-string xds-token-string">&quot;effort&quot;</span>: <span class="astryx-token-string xds-token-string">&quot;high&quot;</span></span></div><div data-line="8" class="x17iicif"><span class="xeuugli">  <span class="astryx-token-punctuation xds-token-punctuation">}</span>,</span></div><div data-line="9" class="x17iicif"><span class="xeuugli">  <span class="astryx-token-string xds-token-string">&quot;input&quot;</span>: <span class="astryx-token-string xds-token-string">&quot;Plan the upgrade of a Flask app from SQLAlchemy 1.4 to 2.0: list the breaking changes to check and the order to make them in.&quot;</span></span></div><div data-line="10" class="x17iicif"><span class="xeuugli"><span class="astryx-token-punctuation xds-token-punctuation">}</span>&#x27;</span></div></code></div></div></pre></figure>
<p class="astryx-text body primary x1tgivj0 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e x1lliihq pfo4z36 p1ewvobj" data-type="body" data-color="primary">For the same call in Python or TypeScript, follow the <a to="/docs/quickstart#first-call" class="astryx-link accent x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk xjse4m1 x17qfo7y x1bvjpef" data-color="accent" href="/docs/quickstart#first-call"><span class="astryx-text body accent xjse4m1 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e xt0psk2" data-type="body" data-color="accent">quickstart</span></a> and set the model to <code class="astryx-code primary x9m5x89 xp03k98 x15bjb6t xwmxj5m x7a5moj x1hp7d8q xx3sua9 x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1tgivj0" data-color="primary">muse-wonder-1.0</code>.</p>
<p class="astryx-text body primary x1tgivj0 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e x1lliihq pfo4z36 p1ewvobj" data-type="body" data-color="primary"><a to="/docs/muse-code" class="astryx-link accent x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk xjse4m1 x17qfo7y x1bvjpef" data-color="accent" href="/docs/muse-code"><span class="astryx-text body accent xjse4m1 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e xt0psk2" data-type="body" data-color="accent">Muse Code</span></a> subscription plans can also include Muse Wonder Full and Contributor mode; see <a to="/docs/models#muse-wonder-availability" class="astryx-link accent x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk xjse4m1 x17qfo7y x1bvjpef" data-color="accent" href="/docs/models#muse-wonder-availability"><span class="astryx-text body accent xjse4m1 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e xt0psk2" data-type="body" data-color="accent">Muse Wonder availability</span></a>. To decide between Muse Wonder and Muse Spark, see <a to="/docs/models#choose-muse-wonder-or-muse-spark" class="astryx-link accent x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk xjse4m1 x17qfo7y x1bvjpef" data-color="accent" href="/docs/models#choose-muse-wonder-or-muse-spark"><span class="astryx-text body accent xjse4m1 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e xt0psk2" data-type="body" data-color="accent">Choose Muse Wonder or Muse Spark</span></a>.</p>
<p class="astryx-text body primary x1tgivj0 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e x1lliihq pfo4z36 p1ewvobj" data-type="body" data-color="primary">Muse Wonder is in preview.</p>
<h2 class="astryx-heading level-2 primary x1tgivj0 x1xvnhcw x1cpk1wn x12yy4cs x1lliihq p1pc3f07 p13fuv20 p6gwkdc p11xkdxz phrwaqf pep27e5 p1adxfkp pmsqn1h" data-level="2" data-color="primary" id="muse-spark"><a to="#muse-spark" class="astryx-link primary x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1hl2dhg x4ohgrr x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk x1tgivj0 x4z56r7" data-color="primary" href="#muse-spark"><span class="astryx-text inherit primary x1tgivj0 x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz xt0psk2" data-type="inherit" data-color="primary">Build with Muse Spark</span></a></h2>
<p class="astryx-text body primary x1tgivj0 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e x1lliihq pfo4z36 p1ewvobj" data-type="body" data-color="primary">Call Model API directly, run Muse Code, or connect the coding agent you already use. All three drive the same model over the same auth.</p>
<h3 class="astryx-heading level-3 primary x1tgivj0 xii13ha xwjzt0u x1jcxfy8 x1lliihq p13rv44w p1p37lm5" data-level="3" data-color="primary" id="at-a-glance"><a to="#at-a-glance" class="astryx-link primary x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1hl2dhg x4ohgrr x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk x1tgivj0 x4z56r7" data-color="primary" href="#at-a-glance"><span class="astryx-text inherit primary x1tgivj0 x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz xt0psk2" data-type="inherit" data-color="primary">At a glance</span></a></h3>
<p class="astryx-text body primary x1tgivj0 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e x1lliihq pfo4z36 p1ewvobj" data-type="body" data-color="primary">Everything you need to make your first call.</p>
<div class="astryx-card default x2kkz0m x153u1i6 x7giv3 x1p8z4y0 x1de1mus xw28qpl x9f619 xswhm3q x1mzf5mb xj1bl4l xwuefyo x1gu2k80 x91ghl5 x1i3qcxz xkunwnr x1litavf x1y0btm7 x14i3s5s xs19ii7 x12frdag x1nex4ik xbv1mwh p1ie71f1 p193iq5w peuugli ph8yej3" data-variant="default"><div tabindex="0" role="group" aria-label="Table" class="astryx-table-scroll-wrapper xw2csxc x5lxg6s xojxgvx x1fcf3bl xx6qvi6 xkibk3 xlayyun"><table class="astryx-base-table xh8yej3 x1mwwwfo x1gukg7c x1drmoe9 xjb2p0i x1tgivj0 astryx-table"><tbody><tr class="astryx-table-row x139im0d"><td class="astryx-table-cell xce4md1 xrrkdod xjm74w1 x9f619 xb3r6kr x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1m189uc x9bi00s xpilulx x16dsc37 x92x3c3 x1wp2rvj x1q0q8m5 xw8gpjh"><strong>Base URL</strong></td><td class="astryx-table-cell xce4md1 xrrkdod xjm74w1 x9f619 xb3r6kr x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1m189uc x9bi00s xpilulx x16dsc37 x92x3c3 x1wp2rvj x1q0q8m5 xw8gpjh"><code class="astryx-code primary x9m5x89 xp03k98 x15bjb6t xwmxj5m x7a5moj x1hp7d8q xx3sua9 x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1tgivj0" data-color="primary">https://api.meta.ai/v1</code></td></tr><tr class="astryx-table-row x139im0d"><td class="astryx-table-cell xce4md1 xrrkdod xjm74w1 x9f619 xb3r6kr x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1m189uc x9bi00s xpilulx x16dsc37 x92x3c3 x1wp2rvj x1q0q8m5 xw8gpjh"><strong><a to="/docs/pricing-rate-limits#standard-mode" class="astryx-link accent x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk xjse4m1 x17qfo7y x1bvjpef" data-color="accent" href="/docs/pricing-rate-limits#standard-mode"><span class="astryx-text body accent xjse4m1 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e xt0psk2" data-type="body" data-color="accent">Standard mode</span></a> models</strong></td><td class="astryx-table-cell xce4md1 xrrkdod xjm74w1 x9f619 xb3r6kr x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1m189uc x9bi00s xpilulx x16dsc37 x92x3c3 x1wp2rvj x1q0q8m5 xw8gpjh"><code class="astryx-code primary x9m5x89 xp03k98 x15bjb6t xwmxj5m x7a5moj x1hp7d8q xx3sua9 x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1tgivj0" data-color="primary">muse-spark-1.3</code>, <code class="astryx-code primary x9m5x89 xp03k98 x15bjb6t xwmxj5m x7a5moj x1hp7d8q xx3sua9 x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1tgivj0" data-color="primary">muse-spark-1.2</code>, <code class="astryx-code primary x9m5x89 xp03k98 x15bjb6t xwmxj5m x7a5moj x1hp7d8q xx3sua9 x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1tgivj0" data-color="primary">muse-spark-1.1</code></td></tr><tr class="astryx-table-row x139im0d"><td class="astryx-table-cell xce4md1 xrrkdod xjm74w1 x9f619 xb3r6kr x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1m189uc x9bi00s xpilulx x16dsc37 x92x3c3 x1wp2rvj x1q0q8m5 xw8gpjh"><strong><a to="/docs/pricing-rate-limits#contributor-mode" class="astryx-link accent x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk xjse4m1 x17qfo7y x1bvjpef" data-color="accent" href="/docs/pricing-rate-limits#contributor-mode"><span class="astryx-text body accent xjse4m1 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e xt0psk2" data-type="body" data-color="accent">Contributor mode</span></a> models</strong></td><td class="astryx-table-cell xce4md1 xrrkdod xjm74w1 x9f619 xb3r6kr x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1m189uc x9bi00s xpilulx x16dsc37 x92x3c3 x1wp2rvj x1q0q8m5 xw8gpjh"><code class="astryx-code primary x9m5x89 xp03k98 x15bjb6t xwmxj5m x7a5moj x1hp7d8q xx3sua9 x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1tgivj0" data-color="primary">muse-spark-1.3-contributor</code>, <code class="astryx-code primary x9m5x89 xp03k98 x15bjb6t xwmxj5m x7a5moj x1hp7d8q xx3sua9 x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1tgivj0" data-color="primary">muse-spark-1.2-contributor</code></td></tr><tr class="astryx-table-row x139im0d"><td class="astryx-table-cell xce4md1 xrrkdod xjm74w1 x9f619 xb3r6kr x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1m189uc x9bi00s xpilulx x16dsc37 x92x3c3 x1wp2rvj x1q0q8m5 xw8gpjh"><strong>Context window</strong></td><td class="astryx-table-cell xce4md1 xrrkdod xjm74w1 x9f619 xb3r6kr x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1m189uc x9bi00s xpilulx x16dsc37 x92x3c3 x1wp2rvj x1q0q8m5 xw8gpjh">1,048,576 tokens</td></tr><tr class="astryx-table-row x139im0d"><td class="astryx-table-cell xce4md1 xrrkdod xjm74w1 x9f619 xb3r6kr x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1m189uc x9bi00s xpilulx x16dsc37 x92x3c3 x1wp2rvj x1q0q8m5 xw8gpjh"><strong>Auth</strong></td><td class="astryx-table-cell xce4md1 xrrkdod xjm74w1 x9f619 xb3r6kr x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1m189uc x9bi00s xpilulx x16dsc37 x92x3c3 x1wp2rvj x1q0q8m5 xw8gpjh">Bearer token (<code class="astryx-code primary x9m5x89 xp03k98 x15bjb6t xwmxj5m x7a5moj x1hp7d8q xx3sua9 x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1tgivj0" data-color="primary">MODEL_API_KEY</code>)</td></tr><tr class="astryx-table-row x139im0d"><td class="astryx-table-cell xce4md1 xrrkdod xjm74w1 x9f619 xb3r6kr x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1m189uc x9bi00s xpilulx x16dsc37 x92x3c3 x1wp2rvj x1q0q8m5 xw8gpjh"><strong>Pricing</strong></td><td class="astryx-table-cell xce4md1 xrrkdod xjm74w1 x9f619 xb3r6kr x1mzt3pk x13faqbe x1m189uc x9bi00s xpilulx x16dsc37 x92x3c3 x1wp2rvj x1q0q8m5 xw8gpjh">Pay-as-you-go; see <a to="/docs/pricing-rate-limits#muse-spark-pricing" class="astryx-link accent x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk xjse4m1 x17qfo7y x1bvjpef" data-color="accent" href="/docs/pricing-rate-limits#muse-spark-pricing"><span class="astryx-text body accent xjse4m1 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e xt0psk2" data-type="body" data-color="accent">Pricing and rate limits</span></a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<h3 class="astryx-heading level-3 primary x1tgivj0 xii13ha xwjzt0u x1jcxfy8 x1lliihq p13rv44w p1p37lm5" data-level="3" data-color="primary" id="call-the-api"><a to="#call-the-api" class="astryx-link primary x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1hl2dhg x4ohgrr x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk x1tgivj0 x4z56r7" data-color="primary" href="#call-the-api"><span class="astryx-text inherit primary x1tgivj0 x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz xt0psk2" data-type="inherit" data-color="primary">Call the API directly</span></a></h3>
<p class="astryx-text body primary x1tgivj0 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e x1lliihq pfo4z36 p1ewvobj" data-type="body" data-color="primary">Model API is drop-in compatible with the OpenAI SDK, the Anthropic SDK, and OpenAI-compatible agent CLIs. Set your client&#x27;s base URL, add your key, and keep the rest of your code.</p>
<p class="astryx-text body primary x1tgivj0 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e x1lliihq pfo4z36 p1ewvobj" data-type="body" data-color="primary">Walk through your first call in the <a to="/docs/quickstart" class="astryx-link accent x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk xjse4m1 x17qfo7y x1bvjpef" data-color="accent" href="/docs/quickstart"><span class="astryx-text body accent xjse4m1 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e xt0psk2" data-type="body" data-color="accent">quickstart</span></a>, or compare request formats in <a to="/docs/protocols" class="astryx-link accent x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk xjse4m1 x17qfo7y x1bvjpef" data-color="accent" href="/docs/protocols"><span class="astryx-text body accent xjse4m1 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e xt0psk2" data-type="body" data-color="accent">Choosing an API</span></a>.</p>
<h3 class="astryx-heading level-3 primary x1tgivj0 xii13ha xwjzt0u x1jcxfy8 x1lliihq p13rv44w p1p37lm5" data-level="3" data-color="primary" id="existing-stack"><a to="#existing-stack" class="astryx-link primary x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1hl2dhg x4ohgrr x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk x1tgivj0 x4z56r7" data-color="primary" href="#existing-stack"><span class="astryx-text inherit primary x1tgivj0 x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz xt0psk2" data-type="inherit" data-color="primary">Connect your coding agent</span></a></h3>
<p class="astryx-text body primary x1tgivj0 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e x1lliihq pfo4z36 p1ewvobj" data-type="body" data-color="primary">Already have a coding agent? Connect it to Model API and keep working. Muse Spark drives the same agentic loop of file edits, shell commands, and tool calls over an OpenAI- or Anthropic-compatible surface.</p>
<div role="status" class="x78zum5 xdt5ytf xjb2p0i x1gnnqk1 p1ie71f1 p193iq5w peuugli"><div class="astryx-banner card info x78zum5 x1cy8zhl x1txdalj x8o8v82 x1pzlopt xgcxg3y x1hviunn" data-container="card" data-status="info"><div class="astryx-banner-icon info x78zum5 x6s0dn4 x2lah0s" data-status="info" aria-hidden="true"><span aria-hidden="true" class="astryx-icon md accent x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 xl56j7k x2lah0s xqwr325 xwqq7k2 xmll18r x1603h9y" data-size="md" data-color="accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" width="1em" height="1em" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 3a9 9 0 100 18 9 9 0 000-18zm0 4a1 1 0 100 2 1 1 0 000-2zm-.75 3.75a.75.75 0 011.5 0v5.5a.75.75 0 01-1.5 0v-5.5z"></path></svg></span></div><div class="x78zum5 xdt5ytf xxhr3t x98rzlu xeuugli"><div class="x1ghz6dp xjb2p0i xcr08ib x2mo6ok x1kq96og x1tgivj0">Muse Spark Open</div><div class="x1ghz6dp xjb2p0i x141an7d x1sodnla x1ltkj2j xv1l7n4"><p class="astryx-text body primary x1tgivj0 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e x1lliihq pfo4z36 p1ewvobj" data-type="body" data-color="primary">Alongside our hosted models, you can also download <a to="#muse-spark-open" class="astryx-link accent x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk xjse4m1 x17qfo7y x1bvjpef" data-color="accent" href="#muse-spark-open"><span class="astryx-text body accent xjse4m1 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e xt0psk2" data-type="body" data-color="accent">Muse Spark Open</span></a>, the open-weight release of Muse Spark, and run it on your own GPUs.</p></div></div></div></div>
<h2 class="astryx-heading level-2 primary x1tgivj0 x1xvnhcw x1cpk1wn x12yy4cs x1lliihq p1pc3f07 p13fuv20 p6gwkdc p11xkdxz phrwaqf pep27e5 p1adxfkp pmsqn1h" data-level="2" data-color="primary" id="muse-image"><a to="#muse-image" class="astryx-link primary x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1hl2dhg x4ohgrr x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk x1tgivj0 x4z56r7" data-color="primary" href="#muse-image"><span class="astryx-text inherit primary x1tgivj0 x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz xt0psk2" data-type="inherit" data-color="primary">Build with Muse Image</span></a></h2>
<p class="astryx-text body primary x1tgivj0 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e x1lliihq pfo4z36 p1ewvobj" data-type="body" data-color="primary">Muse Image generates and edits images through Model API. Send a text prompt and get an image back, refine it across turns, or edit an existing image. It uses the same base URL and auth as Muse Spark.</p>
<h3 class="astryx-heading level-3 primary x1tgivj0 xii13ha xwjzt0u x1jcxfy8 x1lliihq p13rv44w p1p37lm5" data-level="3" data-color="primary" id="muse-image-at-a-glance"><a to="#muse-image-at-a-glance" class="astryx-link primary x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1hl2dhg x4ohgrr x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk x1tgivj0 x4z56r7" data-color="primary" href="#muse-image-at-a-glance"><span class="astryx-text inherit primary x1tgivj0 x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz xt0psk2" data-type="inherit" data-color="primary">At a glance</span></a></h3>
<p class="astryx-text body primary x1tgivj0 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e x1lliihq pfo4z36 p1ewvobj" data-type="body" data-color="primary">Everything you need to make your first image request.</p>
