<p class="astryx-text body primary x1tgivj0 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e x1lliihq pfo4z36 p1ewvobj" data-type="body" data-color="primary">Segment your first image in the <a to="/docs/media-segmentation" class="astryx-link accent x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk xjse4m1 x17qfo7y x1bvjpef" data-color="accent" href="/docs/media-segmentation"><span class="astryx-text body accent xjse4m1 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e xt0psk2" data-type="body" data-color="accent">Media segmentation guide</span></a>.</p>
<h2 class="astryx-heading level-2 primary x1tgivj0 x1xvnhcw x1cpk1wn x12yy4cs x1lliihq p1pc3f07 p13fuv20 p6gwkdc p11xkdxz phrwaqf pep27e5 p1adxfkp pmsqn1h" data-level="2" data-color="primary" id="muse-spark-open"><a to="#muse-spark-open" class="astryx-link primary x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1hl2dhg x4ohgrr x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk x1tgivj0 x4z56r7" data-color="primary" href="#muse-spark-open"><span class="astryx-text inherit primary x1tgivj0 x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz xt0psk2" data-type="inherit" data-color="primary">Build with Muse Spark Open</span></a></h2>
<p class="astryx-text body primary x1tgivj0 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e x1lliihq pfo4z36 p1ewvobj" data-type="body" data-color="primary">Muse Spark Open is the open-weight release of Muse Spark: an 816B-parameter mixture-of-experts model with 42B active parameters that reads text, images, audio, and video and writes text. Instead of calling it over Model API, you download the BF16 or NVFP4 checkpoint and serve it on your own GPUs with a runtime such as SGLang or vLLM, or call it through a hosted inference provider.</p>
<p class="astryx-text body primary x1tgivj0 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e x1lliihq pfo4z36 p1ewvobj" data-type="body" data-color="primary">You run Muse Spark Open yourself or through a hosted provider, not on Model API, so the API pricing and specs above don&#x27;t apply. Its own documentation section covers how to get the model, prompt it, run it, and post-train it.</p>
<ul role="list" class="astryx-list compact disc x1ghz6dp x1c1uobl x3ct3a4 x78zum5 xdt5ytf x1lsbc85 xif0320 pfo4z36 peuugli p1ewvobj" data-density="compact" data-list-style="disc">
