<h2 class="astryx-heading level-2 primary x1tgivj0 x1xvnhcw x1cpk1wn x12yy4cs x1lliihq p1pc3f07 p13fuv20 p6gwkdc p11xkdxz phrwaqf pep27e5 p1adxfkp pmsqn1h" data-level="2" data-color="primary" id="protocols"><a to="#protocols" class="astryx-link primary x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1hl2dhg x4ohgrr x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk x1tgivj0 x4z56r7" data-color="primary" href="#protocols"><span class="astryx-text inherit primary x1tgivj0 x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz xt0psk2" data-type="inherit" data-color="primary">Protocols</span></a></h2>
<p class="astryx-text body primary x1tgivj0 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e x1lliihq pfo4z36 p1ewvobj" data-type="body" data-color="primary">Pick the request format your code already speaks: same models, same auth, same cost per token. These are Model API surfaces. A self-hosted Muse Spark Open server exposes its own OpenAI-compatible endpoint through <a to="/docs/muse-spark-open/deploy#sglang" class="astryx-link accent x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk xjse4m1 x17qfo7y x1bvjpef" data-color="accent" href="/docs/muse-spark-open/deploy#sglang"><span class="astryx-text body accent xjse4m1 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e xt0psk2" data-type="body" data-color="accent">SGLang</span></a> or <a to="/docs/muse-spark-open/deploy#vllm" class="astryx-link accent x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk xjse4m1 x17qfo7y x1bvjpef" data-color="accent" href="/docs/muse-spark-open/deploy#vllm"><span class="astryx-text body accent xjse4m1 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e xt0psk2" data-type="body" data-color="accent">vLLM</span></a>. A local Muse Glimmer server does the same through <a to="/docs/muse-glimmer/deploy#vllm" class="astryx-link accent x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk xjse4m1 x17qfo7y x1bvjpef" data-color="accent" href="/docs/muse-glimmer/deploy#vllm"><span class="astryx-text body accent xjse4m1 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e xt0psk2" data-type="body" data-color="accent">vLLM</span></a> or <a to="/docs/muse-glimmer/deploy#llama-cpp" class="astryx-link accent x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk xjse4m1 x17qfo7y x1bvjpef" data-color="accent" href="/docs/muse-glimmer/deploy#llama-cpp"><span class="astryx-text body accent xjse4m1 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e xt0psk2" data-type="body" data-color="accent">llama.cpp</span></a>. See <a to="/docs/protocols" class="astryx-link accent x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1lsbc85 xjb2p0i x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1pd3egz x1ypdohk x1mpt4pi xuedmi6 xlr8y92 x17nn4n9 x1wfwxd8 x7s97pk xjse4m1 x17qfo7y x1bvjpef" data-color="accent" href="/docs/protocols"><span class="astryx-text body accent xjse4m1 xjm74w1 xw6l6zx xxovm9e xt0psk2" data-type="body" data-color="accent">Choosing an API</span></a> to compare the request formats.</p>
